{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_10","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"sed -n '1,220p' openspec/changes/lint-audit-skill/mission/handoffs/task-1.md && sed -n '1,220p' openspec/changes/lint-audit-skill/mission/handoffs/task-2.md\"","aggregated_output":"Implemented Task 1 and committed it.\n\nCommit: `e2ce827b1eebb85fa9cf085c24c94f1ae17761be`\n\nAdded:\n- [rules.json](/Users/stuart/.darkfactory/skills/lint-audit/rules.json) with oxlint `1.67.0` and 14 rules\n- [validate-rules-json.sh](/Users/stuart/.darkfactory/skills/lint-audit/tests/validate-rules-json.sh) schema test\n- [task-1.md](/Users/stuart/.darkfactory/openspec/changes/lint-audit-skill/mission/handoffs/task-1.md) handoff report, intentionally uncommitted so it can name the final SHA\n\nChecks run:\n- `skills/lint-audit/tests/validate-rules-json.sh` -> pass\n- `jq '.rules | length' skills/lint-audit/rules.json` -> `14`\n- `git diff --cached --check` -> pass before commit\n\nOne concern is captured in the handoff: `typescript/no-floating-promises` is default-enabled only when oxlint type-aware linting is enabled, so Task 2 should combine `default_enabled` with its `type_aware` detection.\n\nSources used: [Oxc latest release](https://github.com/oxc-project/oxc), [type-aware linting](https://oxc.rs/docs/guide/usage/linter/type-aware.html), [no-floating-promises](https://oxc.rs/docs/guide/usage/linter/rules/typescript/no-floating-promises.html), [no-unused-vars](https://oxc.rs/docs/guide/usage/linter/rules/eslint/no-unused-vars.html).Implemented and committed Task 2.\n\nCommit: `3057c01d02d80fa9228693938ddc32cb02535c4c`\n\nChanged:\n- [audit.sh](/Users/stuart/.darkfactory/skills/lint-audit/audit.sh)\n- [audit-sh.sh](/Users/stuart/.darkfactory/skills/lint-audit/tests/audit-sh.sh)\n- [task-2.md](/Users/stuart/.darkfactory/openspec/changes/lint-audit-skill/mission/handoffs/task-2.md) written after commit so it can name the final SHA, matching the task-1 pattern\n\nChecks run:\n- `skills/lint-audit/tests/audit-sh.sh` -> pass\n- `sh -n skills/lint-audit/audit.sh` -> pass\n- `sh -n skills/lint-audit/tests/audit-sh.sh` -> pass\n- `skills/lint-audit/tests/validate-rules-json.sh` -> pass\n- `git diff --cached --check` -> pass before commit\n\nI left unrelated existing changes alone: `UBIQUITOUS_LANGUAGE.md`, `skills/language/SKILL.md`, and the pre-existing untracked OpenSpec folder content.","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
